    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="161b61e3-e968-5b22-9985-ac86af4e0a62" activityNameId="11e269a0-601f-5f1d-93a1-354ce1c2f7de" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Grass from natural meadow intensive IP, at field</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Grass from natural meadow intensive IP, at field
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of fresh grass from intensive IP production with 1.66 kg CO2  and 17.9 MJ per kg dry matter. The dry matter content of fresh gras is about 10-15% ;
UUID: a97b5600-4d88-326c-ab6b-db2a1ebfe5c6
The inventories include the cultivation of grass on a permanent meadow. Included steps are fertilisation (slurry and ammonium nitrate), harvest, loading for transport.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Intensive IP production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume:  
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a97b5600-4d88-326c-ab6b-db2a1ebfe5c6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
